  "steps": [
    "Tomatoes. Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Add the tomatoes cut side down, cover and cook 8 minutes until blistered. Remove the skins and mash gently.",
    "Sauce base. Add celery, onion, pepper, garlic and seasoning. Add tomato paste and cook until brick red; let simmer.",
    "Meat. In another pan, crisp the sausage, then add the beef and brown. Drain and set aside.",
    "Boursin. After about 10 minutes of simmering, stir in the broth and Boursin. Add the meat.",
    "Pasta. Cook the spaghetti until al dente, add to the sauce, mix well and simmer a few minutes.",
    "Serve. Top with fresh Parmesan."
